Applet id: `{{ id }}`.

Run `npm install`, then `glimpsectl applet run --dev .`: it loads `devconfig.toml` and attaches the
applet with its options and env. Options edits update it; source
edits restart it. The desktop entry runs `node --run start` to build and launch it.
`npm run check` type-checks.

The justfile wraps the whole loop: `just dev`, `just test`, `just lint`, `just package`,
`just install`.

Add `center = ["{{ id }}"]` to a panel's applet zone.
